      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Its history dates back to the early 19th century, and much of its development can be tied to the industrial growth of the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
